  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction sphere (Fire Blast (blast type, fire)).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When a creature is set on fire by your destructive blast, they must succeed at a Will save each round they remain on fire or become shaken. If shaken, they become frightened. If frightened, they become panicked. A successful save reduces the severity by one step and ending the on fire condition ends the effects of this feat, though not fear conditions from other sources.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/combat-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
